 "strings": {
  "Thank you, sir.": "",
  "Matsugane-san.": "",
  "Hmmm... So...": "",
  "You're really gonna go\nthrough with this?": "",
  "Kaito-san's really out?": "",
  "It's done, Tak.\nKaito's out.": "",
  "Fine, then. He's expelled.": "",
  "From this point forward?\nAre you sure about that?": "",
  "Right now? This very second?": "",
  "I'm certain.": "",
  "...Yes.": "",
  "Good news, Kaito-san.\nYou get to keep your pinky.": "",
  "Then you get to keep your finger, Kaito-san.": "",
  "You don't get to decide that.": "",
  "You don't get a say on that!": "",
  "Yakuza cut off their fingers to show\naccountability for the things they do.": "",
  "Cutting off fingers is how\nthe yakuza take responsibility, right?": "",
  "A civilian like Kaito-san\nhas no reason to do that.": "",
  "But Kaito-san's a civilian as of now.": "",
  "The fuck do you think you are!?": "",
  "You don't even belong here!": "",
  "With all due respect, your own boss\njust said Kaito's not yakuza anymore... Captain.": "",
  "Your patriarch just said\nKaito-san's a civilian... Captain.": "",
  "Back off.": "",
  "Tak.": "",
  "I'll do what I've gotta.": "",
  "You're out of line.": "",
  "This is how it's\ngonna have to be.": "",
  "This is how a man owns his mistakes.": "",
  "I'm not afraid.\nI'm yakuza, dammit!": "",
  "I've already made up my mind!": "",
  "Wait!": "",
  "Stop!": "",
  "Kaito!": "",
  "You're not Matsugane Family\nor yakuza anymore.": "",
  "You aren't one of our boys anymore.": "",
  "You hear? I don't need your pinky,\nso just... Go.": "",
  "I don't need some civilian's bloody pinkie.": "",
  "Boss...": "",
  "B-Boss...": "",
  "Bad move, dumbass.": "",
  "Who the fuck...?": "",
  "Open the fucking safe.": "",
  "Open the safe.": "",
  "Hurry up or I'll kill you.": "",
  "Resist and you die.": "",
  "Interesting.": "",
  "Well then, you better make it count.\nOtherwise, it's gonna be my turn.": "",
  "You gonna make the first shot count?\nOtherwise you're the dead man.": "",
  "Apparently, the poor guy was polishing\nhis boss' shoes off in the corner.": "",
  "He was down on the floor,\npolishing the boss's shoes.": "",
  "By the time he figured out what\nwas going on, he was fucked.": "",
  "But by the time he realized what\nwas happening, it was too late.": "",
  "Okay then. You got me.": "",
  "Fine. You win.": "",
  "The money's yours.": "",
  "I yield.": "",
  "I'll just... Go get it.": "",
  "Just take the damn money.": "",
  "Higashi couldn't forget that face if he\ntried. It was seared into his memory.": "",
  "Higashi burned that thief's face, build,\nand features into his memory.": "",
  "You could say it all worked out\nfor the best, since no one got killed.": "",
  "No one died, so you might say\nit was a best-case scenario.": "",
  "You could also say Higashi abandoned his\naniki and let the thief get away.": "",
  "But you could also say he watched a\nthief walk away with 100 mil.": "",
  "And that's one way for\na yakuza to lose a finger.\n\n": "",
  "The yakuza cut fingers off for that.": "",
  "Higashi-san!": "",
  "Yagami's here.\nAnd Kaito's with him!": "",
  "Yagami's here. And Kaito too!": "",
  "Wow. Never thought I'd see\nyou roll in here, Kaito-san.": "",
  "What's the meaning of this, Kaito-san?": "",
  "Only seemed fair after what\nyou pulled. Look, we need to talk. ": "",
  "You're the one who busted\ninto our place first.": "",
  "And about what, exactly?": "",
  "I said, what the hell\nare you doing here?": "",
  "Higashi.": "",
  "Higashi. Did you...": "",
  "Red Nose.\nDid you kill him last year?": "",
  "...Kill Red Nose?": "",
  "Who?": "",
  "Don't play dumb.\nThe guy who broke into the Matsugane Family Office.": "",
  "The thief who broke into the\nMatsugane Family office a year ago.": "",
  "Look, we already know you\ngot the money back from him.": "",
  "You're the one who got\nthe money back from him, right?": "",
  "And not long after...": "",
  "But around the same time...": "",
  "Red Nose turned up\ndead in the sewers. ": "",
  "...Someone ID'd Red Nose's corpse.": "",
  "As for the cause...\nIt seems he'd been shot.": "",
  "He'd been shot,\nand left floating in the sewer.": "",
  "Higashi-san!?": "",
  "Higashi-san...!": "",
  "Motherfucker.\nHow dare you.": "",
  "Enough. How dare you?": "",
  "I need you to answer me.\nDid you kill Red Nose or not?": "",
  "Did you really kill him?": "",
  "Start talkin', Higashi!": "",
  "Answer him, Higashi!": "",
  "I did it for you, man.\nIf I coulda just gotten the money...": "",
  "Back then...\nI just wanted to help my aniki.": "",
  "Maybe they wouldn't have kicked you\nout of the fuckin' family.": "",
  "I thought if I got the money back,\nyou could come back too.": "",
  "I was ready...\nTo do whatever I needed to do.": "",
  "I was ready to do whatever it took.": "",
  "For Kaito, huh?": "",
  "And yet...": "",
  "If you really mean it,\nthen drop the goddamn gun!": "",
  "Now you're pointing a gun\nat that same guy!?": "",
  "Not a chance!": "",
  "So it's all on the table.\nYou really gonna kill us. Huh, Higashi?": "",
  "You're really ready\nto shoot Tak and I?": "",
  "It's over.": "",
  "That gun of yours...": "",
  "You don't have enough bullets\nin that damn gun. You can't kill us all.": "",
  "...Doesn't have enough bullets\nto silence all of us.": "",
  "What the...": "",
  "What!?": "",
  "Son of a...!": "",
  "Bastard!": "",
  "Damn you, Yagami!": "",
  "The hell're you doing!?\nTake 'em out!": "",
  "What are you doing!?\nGet them!": "",
  "Thanks for that.\nNow go!": "",
  "Clear out, old timers!": "",
  "Fuck you!": "",
  "You're fuckin' dead!": "",
  "God damn that felt good!\nC'mon!": "",
  "Finally my big moment, Tak!": "",
  "Yeah...": "",
  "This is what I pay you for, Kaito-san.": "",
  "Time to earn your salary!": "",
  "Fuck yeah!": "",
  "Hell yeah!": "",
  "Who's there?\nCome out!": "",
  "Who's there!?\nShow yourself!": "",
  "Hamura?\nIs that him...?": "",
  "Captain Hamura...?": "",
  "It's Higashi, sir!": "",
  "C-Captain...!?": "",
  "Sorry to barge in\non you like this.": "",
  "It's me! Higashi!": "",
  "Higashi... What in the fuck\nare you doing here? Are you alone?": "",
  "Higashi? Why are you here, fool?\nYou alone?": "",
  "I, uh... I don't know if you realize,\nbut that's the guy!": "",
  "Um... That homeless guy...": "",
  "That's Red Nose! He stole the\n100 mil from our office!": "",
  "That's \"Red Nose,\" the guy who\nstole the hundred million!": "",
  "Sorry, Red Nose.\nThis is nothing personal.": "",
  "It's nothing personal.\nBlame this idiot.": "",
  "Captain...?": "",
  "...Why!?": "",
  "Hey, uh...\nThat really a good idea?": "",
  "Captain, sure that's not a bad call?": "",
  "Tell me.": "",
  "Talk.": "",
  "How'd you find out\nRed Nose was the thief?": "",
  "How did you know he was the thief?": "",
  "I, uh... Well, I...": "",
  "W-Well...": "",
  "What was I supposed to do?\nI told him everything.": "",
  "I told him the whole story.": "",
  "How I was in the office when\nthe thief broke in and stole the money.": "",
  "Told him how I was actually\nthere when he hit the office.": "",
  "How I bought police info from Ayabe\nand followed the trail to Red Nose.": "",
  "How I bribed Ayabe to get a lead on Red Nose.": "",
  "I kept talking, like my fucking life\ndepended on it. Probably did, to be honest.": "",
  "It felt like he would shoot me if\nI stopped talking, so I kept jabbering.": "",
  "Real insightful.": "",
  "I get it.": "",
  "You did all that so you could clear\nyour buddy Kaito's name, huh?": "",
  "So, you were trying to clear Kaito's name?": "",
  "Aren't you just the most\nloyal boy in town?": "",
  "What a good boy.": "",
  "Please... Don't shoot...": "",
  "Don't kill me!": "",
  "Whatever it is you want!\nI'm begging you, Captain!": "",
  "Please! Lemme live!": "",
  "But, Captain. Hold on.\nYou sure?": "",
  "Captain, you're really gonna...?": "",
  "Probably right.": "",
  "That depends...": "",
  "You wanna stay alive...\nYou show us some loyalty.": "",
  "If you want to live,\npledge your loyalty to me.": "",
  "Prove yourself once and for all.": "",
  "And I'll need you to prove it.": "",
  "But how? How can I?": "",
  "But... How!?": "",
  "Here's how.": "",
  "Finish it.": "",
  "If you hadn't shown up,\nhe might've gotten to live.": "",
  "He wouldn't have had to die\nif you didn't show your sorry face.": "",
  "Not only that,\nhe'd be 10 million yen richer.": "",
  "Not only that...\nHe would've walked away 10 million richer.": "",
  "Poor guy, right?": "",
  "Poor son of a bitch.\nHis blood's on your hands, you know.": "",
  "You're the one who killed him.": "",
  "No!": "",
  "Nooo!": "",
  "Oh wow.\nYou scream like a fucking whore.": "",
  "You scream like a woman, you know.": "",
  "Kind of a turn on to be honest.": "",
  "Kinda gets me going.": "",
  "What are you so upset for?": "",
  "And with that...": "",
  "You're finally a real yakuza now.": "",
  "...You're a real yakuza now.": "",
  "When Tak was younger...": "",
  "When Tak was younger...　": "",
  "His parents were both\nstabbed to death.": "",
  "His parents were butchered\nwith a kitchen knife.　": "",
  "Tak was at a friend's\nhouse when it happened.": "",
  "They worked all the time,\nso he was going through his rebel phase.": "",
  "He was there to avoid them,\npissed about the hours they were working.": "",
  "He was crashing at a friend's\nplace when it happened.": "",
  "But maybe if he'd been home...": "",
  "If he'd been home...": "",
  "Maybe he could've done\nsomething. Anything.": "",
  "...Maybe he could have stopped the guy.　": "",
  "Maybe his parents would\nstill be alive.": "",
  "Maybe they'd still be alive.　": "",
  "So, Higashi.": "",
  "Hey, Higashi...": "",
  "Tell me— you have a good reason\nyou aren't doing what I asked?": "",
  "There a reason you\nhaven't done as I asked?": "",
  "No. I don't, boss.": "",
  "No, it's not that I...": "",
  "You sure could use one with\nTak still hanging around.": "",
  "Then why is Tak\nstill even in play!?": "",
  "It's time to start doing\nyour damn job!": "",
  "You're too sloppy\nfor him to take seriously!": "",
  "Got a light?": "",
  "Yo.": "",
  "Sir.": "",
  "Cap's awfully tense lately.": "",
  "Is it me, or does the captain...": "",
  "Kinda kills the whole room, y'know?": "",
  "...Kinda suffocate the office, y'know?": "",
  "He's always in such a bad mood.": "",
  "Why's he always so damn sour?": "",
  "Die!": "",
  "Dieeeeee!": "",
  "Ahhh...!": "",
  "See? Hamura's knows he's a target. And I believe he's\nnot the only one who should be worried about himself.": "",
  "And, from what I hear, the lawyer who\ngot Hamura off the hook is a target too.": "",
  "Do you get the picture?": "",
  "That'd be you.": "",
  "Keep your eyes open.": "",
  "You need to tread carefully.": "",
  "I'm telling you this as a friend.": ""
 },
